    "note": "third reader: as passed by its first chamber. Amendments made after the version read are not in the text read. Floor amendment replaced a single exception with several: law enforcement officers, and a resident lawfully moving a firearm to their residence or vehicle within 100 feet. Struck numbering is re-lettered in the text. § 16–903 swaps 'gun' for 'FIREARM' (word change only). Passed Senate 33-13."
